This demo illustrates a basic integration between a PHP backend and a sample React application that includes SurveyJS Survey Creator and Form Library.

SurveyJS Form Library is available under the MIT license.

Survey Creator is proprietary software. You can integrate it and evaluate its functionality without a license. Production use requires a commercial license for each developer who works with the SurveyJS APIs or implements the integration.

For full licensing details, please refer to the SurveyJS Licensing FAQ and End-User License Agreement (EULA):

- https://surveyjs.io/faq#licensing
- https://surveyjs.io/Developer-License-Agreement.pdf
